{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EsKvBk28UjMirH1VbLryap","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 event-gated-adaptive-horizon 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (29 个)\\n\\n- **exp_010a_cheetah_baseline_s1**: QUEUED — \\n- **exp_009f_008f_walker_s1**: QUEUED — \\n- **exp_007_fixed_dt4**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_006_fixed_dt2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_008d_subsample_on_h8**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_008e_subsample_on_fixed_dt1**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_008e_subsample_on_dt1_h15**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_005_event_gated_v4**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_004_event_gated_v3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_003_event_gated_v2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_002_event_gated**: DONE (failed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp_008e_v3_walker_s2 | Walker Walk trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imag + H=15 seed 2 — crown jewel C6 seed 2 验证 | — | — | — |\\n| exp_009a_baseline_walker_s2 | Walker Walk baseline seed 2 — 多 seed 复现 exp_001 baseline，建立 v/e 校准参考（plan_010） | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_009d_baseline_walker_s1: Walker Walk baseline seed 1 — 多 seed 复现 exp_001 baseline，建立 v/e 校准参考（plan_010）（排队等待 GPU）\\n- exp_009e_008d_walker_s1: Walker Walk trained dt_emb + subsample ON + H=8 seed 1 — 多 seed 复现 008d delusional critic collapse，巩固 C2 统计显著性（plan_011）（排队等待 GPU）\\n- exp_010a_cheetah_baseline_s1: Cheetah Run baseline seed 1 — 建立第二环境 dt=1 参考基线，为跨环境验证 C1/C2 做准备（plan_020）（排队等待 GPU）\\n- exp_009f_008f_walker_s1: Walker Walk dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON + H=8 seed 1 — 多 seed 复现 008f 因果控制稳定性，巩固 C2 统计显著性（plan_012）（排队等待 GPU）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp_008e_v3_walker_s1** (success): Walker Walk trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imag + H=15 seed 1 — crown jewel C6 验证：trained dt_emb 在 dt=1 imagination 下不触发 delusional critic（plan_014） ← 基于 exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\n- **exp_006** (killed): —\\n  [exp_006_full_metrics](/api/workspace-files/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/exp_006/report/exp_006_full_metrics.md)\\n- **exp_008a** (killed): —\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 6 / 负向 9 / 失败 1 / 共 23\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nbjb1-45299: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- exp_002_event_gated: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_006: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008a: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008c: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008d: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_fixed_dt1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008e_v2_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NffiMbstUvbyNNqNDpX5gE","session_id":"897ba80d-7ac0-4ab3-8af6-91e374677a7e","uuid":"3a5936c9-c7df-4fd7-8204-ffa802cab9d9","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:55:52.286Z"}
