/2 exceed).\n1236\t    extra:\n1237\t      hook_events:\n1238\t      - event: on_complete\n1239\t        action: agent\n1240\t        ts: '2026-05-14T18:47:21.873692+00:00'\n1241\t    conclusion: negative\n1242\t    checkpoint_path: /root/autodl-tmp/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/logdir/exp_009b_008d_walker_s2/latest.pt\n1243\t    completed_at: '2026-05-14T18:51:00Z'\n1244\t    notes: 'D032: Collapse NOT reproduced in seed 2. nve peaked 2.05x@25K (transient)\n1245\t      then self-corrected to 0.38x@105K. Eval rose to 268. Contrast: seed 1 had SUSTAINED\n1246\t      nve>1.5x at 35K+ (1.71x→2.09x→4.12x) → collapse to 83. Key finding: nve>1.5x\n1247\t      threshold (35K+ steps) is reliable trained dt_emb marker (2/2 seeds), but collapse\n1248\t      is stochastic (1/2). Framing proposal submitted to Director.'\n1249\t    causal_conclusion: Seed 2 nve transiently reached 2.05x@25K (pathological), confirming\n1250\t      trained dt_emb reliably induces nve>1.5x (2/2 seeds). But seed 2 self-corrected\n1251\t      (nve 2.05x→0.38x@105K, eval 141→268) while seed 1 sustained nve>1.5x across\n1252\t      3 consecutive checkpoints at 35K+ (1.71x→2.09x→4.12x) and collapsed (eval 167→83).\n1253\t      Collapse is stochastic (1/2 seeds); nve>1.5x threshold (at 35K+ steps) is a\n1254\t      reliable diagnostic marker with 4/4 separating power (trained 2/2 exceed, untrained\n1255\t      0/2 exceed).\n1256\t  exp_009c_008f_walker_s2:\n1257\t    status: DONE\n1258\t    retry_count: 0\n1259\t    created_at: '2026-05-14T07:17:26.154Z'\n1260\t    updated_at: '2026-05-14T14:34:24.161Z'\n1261\t    hypothesis: Walker Walk dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON + H=8 seed 2 — 多 seed 复现\n1262\t      008f 因果控制稳定性，巩固 C2 统计显著性（plan_012）\n1263\t    parent: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\n1264\t    server: bjb1-45299\n1265\t    gpu: cuda:1\n1266\t    account: root\n1267\t    reproduce:\n1268\t      server: bjb1-45299\n1269\t      gpu: cuda:1"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NffiMbstUvbyNNqNDpX5gE",