count: 0\n1418\t    created_at: '2026-05-14T11:09:52.237Z'\n1419\t    updated_at: '2026-05-14T22:31:48.642Z'\n1420\t    metrics:\n1421\t      baseline:\n1422\t        dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n1423\t        dt2_obs_mse: 27.5\n1424\t        obs_gap: 2.04\n1425\t        dt1_reward_mae: 0.0102\n1426\t        dt2_reward_mae: 0.0159\n1427\t        reward_gap: 1.56\n1428\t      008d_trained_dtEmb:\n1429\t        dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n1430\t        dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n1431\t        obs_gap: 1.3\n1432\t        dt1_reward_mae: 0.0568\n1433\t        dt2_reward_mae: 0.1579\n1434\t        reward_gap: 2.78\n1435\t      008f_no_dtEmb:\n1436\t        dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n1437\t        dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n1438\t        obs_gap: 2.75\n1439\t        dt1_reward_mae: 0.7469\n1440\t        dt2_reward_mae: 0.7526\n1441\t        reward_gap: 1.01\n1442\t    conclusion: success\n1443\t    hypothesis: 'RSSM prediction quality analysis: 比较 baseline/008d/008f 在 dt=1 vs\n1444\t      dt=2 transitions 上的 obs_MSE 和 reward_MAE，量化 RSSM fidelity gap (plan_030)'\n1445\t    notes: 分析实验，非训练实验。conclusion=success，状态从 PREPARING 修正为 DONE（D034 registry 清理）。\n1446\t  exp_008e_v3_walker_s1:\n1447\t    status: DONE\n1448\t    retry_count: 0\n1449\t    created_at: '2026-05-14T14:29:53.120Z'\n1450\t    updated_at: '2026-05-15T00:44:53.439Z'\n1451\t    hypothesis: Walker Walk trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imag + H=15 seed\n1452\t      1 — crown jewel C6 验证：trained dt_emb 在 dt=1 imagination 下不触发 delusional critic（plan_014）\n1453\t    parent: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\n1454\t    notes: 'Crown jewel C6 seed 1 SUCCESS. eval_return=869.9@105K, v/e=0.527 (healthy,\n1455\t      no delusional critic). Gate locked dt=1 throughout. Trajectory: 31→131→156→276→382→487→581→574→657→852→870.\n1456\t      Consistent with seed 0, confirms trained dt_emb + dt=1 imagination is safe.'\n1457\t    gpu: cuda:1\n1458\t    server: bjb1-45299\n1459\t    spec:\n1460\t      command: bash -c \"source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.s