{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JcdiDG8DGtJfrZAWD5d2ci","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# event-gated-adaptive-horizon — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 06:26 UTC | 更新原因: MVP complete → research phase. experiment_plan.yaml created, dream_simulate launched\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**Narrative B+: Diagnostic Analysis of Temporal Abstraction in World-Model RL**\\\\n核心因果链：trained dt_embedding → delusional critic → collapse。Untrained dt_embedding 通过 value growth suppression 实质性保护性能。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n**Target**: CoRL 2026 (DDL 2026-05-29, 剩余 15 天)\\\\n\\\\n## 阶段\\\\n**Research** — MVP 于 2026-05-14 通过（D028: C2 因果确认 + C3 B+ 105K 确认）。experiment_plan.yaml 已创建，Dream 模拟已启动。\\\\n\\\\n## 核心发现（因果链闭合 ✓）\\\\n\\\\n1. **C2 因果确认**：008f（dt_embed_dim=0）normalized v/e=0.73x@35K vs 008d（dim=32）=1.71x。唯一差异是 dt_embedding → delusional critic 消失。\\\\n2. **C3 B+ 确认**：008a 105K=778（85% baseline），normalized v/e=0.59x，两次 V-recovery。结构性 value growth suppression。\\\\n3. **008e_v3 B+ confound 解答中**：untrained dt_emb + subsample ON → normalized v/e=0.88x@45K（正常），保护来自 untrained dt_emb 而非 subsample OFF。\\\\n\\\\n## 诊断框架\\\\n**Normalized v/e ratio** = 实验 v/e / baseline v/e @同 step。>1.5x = pathological; 0.8-1.2x = normal; <0.7x = value suppression。\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划概览（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n\\\\n| 优先级 | 内容 | GPU 预算 | 状态 |\\\\n|--------|------|---------|------|\\\\n| P0 | Walker Walk MVP 实验（8 个） | ~38h done + 10h running | ✅ 6 done, 2 running |\\\\n| P0 | Walker Walk 多 seed（baseline + 008d + 008f × 2 seeds） | ~30h | planned |\\\\n| P0 | Cheetah Run 验证（baseline + trained + dim=0 × 3 seeds） | ~45h | planned |\\\\n| P0 | Cartpole Swingup 验证（baseline + trained + dim=0 × 3 seeds） | ~45h | planned |\\\\n| P0 | Uncertainty-gated truncation pilot（plan_060, actionability） | 5h | planned |\\\\n| P1 | Walker Walk 008a seeds + Cheetah Run C3 + 分析实验 | ~26h | planned |\\\\n| P2 | Hopper Hop + 补充分析 | ~46h | stretch |\\\\n\\\\n**Total P0**: ~145 GPU·h → ~3 days wall time。**Total P0+P1**: ~171 GPU·h → ~3.6 days。时间充裕。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前实验\\\\n\\\\n| 实验 | GPU | Step | 关键数据 |\\\\n|------|-----|------|---------|\\\\n| 008f (cuda:0) | cuda:0 | ~35K | normalized v/e=0.73x ✅ causal confirmed |\\\\n| 008e_v3 (cuda:0/1) | cuda:1 | ~45K | normalized v/e=0.88x, B+ confound |\\\\n| 008a (cuda:0) | cuda:0 | ~112K | 继续跑，免费长期数据 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] complete_mvp（D028）\\\\n- [x] 写 experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n- [x] 启动 dream_simulate (dream_20260514T062606, full review)\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 完成 → 按反馈调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后批准 P0 实验（Walker Walk seeds + Cheetah Run）\\\\n- [ ] 008f 跑到 45K+ 获取更多数据点\\\\n- [ ] 008e_v3 跑到 65K+ 确认长期稳定性\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配：RTX PRO 6000 × 2（bjb1-45299, cuda:0 + cuda:1）\\\\n- MVP 累计消耗：~70 GPU·h\\\\n- Research 阶段 P0 预算：~145 GPU·h（~3 天 wall time）\\\\n- Research 阶段 P0+P1 预算：~171 GPU·h（~3.6 天 wall time）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-14 | D033: 008e_v3 dt_embedding 实际是 trained — C6 保护机制修正 | exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15, exp_008d_subsample_on_h8 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-14 | C2再修订：trained dt_emb → pathological v/e (>1.5x) 是  | exp_009b_008d_walker_s2, exp_008d_subsample_on_h8, exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8, exp_009c_008f_walker_s2 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-14 | 选 Option A narrative（机制+陷阱+正确修复），C6(008e_v3)升为crow | exp_009c_008f_walker_s2, exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15 |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-14 | C2因果链降级：009c(seed 2)显示dt_embed_dim=0可能只延迟而非消除delus | exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8, exp_009c_008f_walker_s2 |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-14 | Dream审稿后战略调整：3 seeds不扩5、frame 008e_v3为mitigation、缩 | exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15, exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8, exp_008d_subsample_on_h8 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-14 | C2 因果归因确认：dt_embedding conditioning 是 delusional c | exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8, exp_008d_subsample_on_h8, exp_008e_v3, exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2 |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-14 | C3 措辞决定：采用 \\\\\\\"preventing optimistic drift\\\\\\\" 而非 \\\\\\\"pessi | exp_001_baseline, exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2, exp_008d_subsample_on_h8 |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-14 | 008d@45K 崩塌确认（v/e=69.3%），kill 008d 释放 cuda:0 给 008 | exp_008d_subsample_on_h8, exp_006_fixed_dt2, exp_008f |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-14 | 008d@45K v/e=69.3% 崩塌确认；kill 008d 释放 cuda:0 给 008f | exp_008d_subsample_on_h8, exp_008f |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-14 | 接受 Reviewer C2 confound 诊断：008e 重新配置为 subsample ON | exp_008d_subsample_on_h8, exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4069, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01KvMFu7t7wxihwPseYjFE5w","session_id":"897ba80d-7ac0-4ab3-8af6-91e374677a7e","uuid":"54f9d065-0be2-40e1-980a-5be2ab0439a5","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:56:48.761Z"}
