{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NYrxqNe1mCv4ZfaKm8cTKo","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 34\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 01:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：dreamerv3-torch + DMC Walker Walk 验证事件门控可行性\\\\n  rationale: 选择 NM512/dreamerv3-torch 作为代码基础（干净 RSSM 实现，方便修改），DMC Walker Walk 作为验证任务（DreamerV3\\\\n    标准基准，快速迭代）。MVP 只验证技术可行性（gate 不坍缩、训练收敛、有效跳步），不验证完整研究假设（长时域信用分配改善需要 ManiSkill3 等长时域任务，留到\\\\n    research 阶段）。Reviewer 主要担忧 impact(3/5) 源于评估任务时长不够长（250 步 StackPyramid 可能只显示中等收益），但这是\\\\n    research 阶段的问题，不影响 MVP 方案。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 01:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 建议：量化 MVP criterion 4 + 补充 kill criteria\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer warning 两点均合理：(1) criterion 4 原为定性描述，改为 Δt 序列自相关 > 0.15 OR 标准差\\\\n    > 0.5，可判定；(2) 补充 kill criteria：MVP GPU 上限 15h，训练发散最多重试 2 次，gate 坍缩则尝试 soft attention\\\\n    mixture fallback，15h 耗尽未过则报告用户决定 kill/pivot。Info 项（entropy 阈值宽松、Walker Walk 缺相位结构、代码基础选择）均\\\\n    acknowledged，MVP 阶段不需要额外动作。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 部署 subsample curriculum 补丁，重启 event-gated 实验 (exp_002→exp_003)\\\\n  rationale: Phase 1 (0-50K) 中 subsample_variable_dt 不应生效但生效了，导致 RSSM 训练数据与 imagination\\\\n    Δt=1 不匹配，event-gated return 仅 40% baseline。这是设计缺陷，不是超参问题。44K 步的污染权重不可恢复，需干净重跑。补丁让子采样跟随\\\\n    gate curriculum：Phase 1 纯 Δt=1，Phase 2 渐进增大，Phase 3 完整 log-uniform。损失 ~1.7h GPU\\\\n    时间（cuda:1），在 15 GPU·h MVP 预算内。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_event_gated\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: return 40% baseline due to Phase 1 subsample mismatch\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 09:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 中期评估：3/4 标准已过（gate 有效），criterion 1 (return) 是风险点，设 150K/200K checkpoint\\\\n    评估 + pivot 方案\\\\n  rationale: 'Step 96K 数据：entropy=1.54>0.3, H_eff=35.7>18, dt_std=1.30>0.5，gate 机制功能验证通过。但\\\\n    return ratio=36.5%（需≥80%），Phase 2 进行 46K 步无恢复趋势。Reviewer 估计 criterion 1 通过概率 15-25%。Plan:\\\\n    Phase 3 稳定后（150K/200K）评估，ratio<50% 则 pivot 到 K=4 + 延长 curriculum。3/4 已过说明 gate\\\\n    机制本身有价值，return 问题可能是 K 太大或 ramp 太快的调参问题。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: gate mechanism works (3/4 criteria pass) but return degrades to 36.5%\\\\n      baseline at step 96K\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 10:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: Return 崩塌根因确认：imagination dt 无约束导致 OOD。修复方案 C（logits masking + clamp），从头重跑\\\\n    exp_004\\\\n  rationale: Agent 代码审查确认 _imagine 中 gate 自由输出 dt∈{1,...,8}，而 world model 训练数据受 subsample\\\\n    curriculum 限制（gate_scale=0.5 时仅见过 dt≤4）。未训练的 dt embedding → RSSM 噪声预测 → reward\\\\n    head 垃圾输出 → actor/critic progressive poisoning → return 从 37% 崩到 10%。修复方案 C：(1)\\\\n    Gate logits masking（dt > effective_max_dt 的 logits 设 -inf）做 soft constraint，(2)\\\\n    torch.clamp 做 hard safety net。不做 checkpoint 恢复（baseline RSSM 架构不含 dt_embedding），从头干净重跑。保持\\\\n    K=8 + 原 curriculum 参数，先验证 bug fix 是否足够恢复 return，若不够再 pivot K=4。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: return catastrophically collapsed to 10% at step 105K due to unconstrained\\\\n      imagination dt\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 10:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 追加修复：_compute_target dt 索引错位 2 位，与 imagination dt clipping 并行修复后重跑 exp_004\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 _compute_target 将 dts[1:] 传入 lambda_return_variable_dt，但\\\\n    dts[t] 是 gate 在 succ_t 处为下一步转移决定的 dt，不是当前步转移 dt。正确序列应为 [init_dt=1, dts[0], ...,\\\\n    dts[H-3]]，实际是 [dts[1], dts[2], ..., dts[H-1]]，每位偏移 2。Phase 1 全 dt=1 不受影响，Phase\\\\n    2+ dt 方差越大错误越严重——完美解释 gate_scale 与 return 的负相关。此 bug 比 imagination dt 无约束更致命：即使\\\\n    imagination dt 被 clip，λ-return 索引错误仍会污染 actor/critic 训练信号。两个 bug 必须同时修复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: dt index misalignment in _compute_target caused progressive λ-return corruption\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 11:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 停止 Walker Walk baseline（已收敛），启动 Cheetah Run baseline 为多环境泛化铺路\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 压力测试结论：单环境（Walker Walk）即使 MVP 全 PASS 也只够 workshop paper，A 类（CoRL\\\\n    DDL 5/29）需要 4-6 个 DMC 环境 + 多 seed + ablation。Walker Walk baseline 已在 ~920 eval_return\\\\n    稳定超过 100K 步，不需要继续跑到 500K。cuda:0 应立即用于铺 Cheetah Run baseline——无论 exp_004 成功（需要多环境验证泛化）还是失败（K=4\\\\n    pivot 也需要多环境），Cheetah baseline 都是必须的。同时 Cheetah Run 是 DreamerV3 标准基准之一，episode\\\\n    结构不同于 Walker Walk，能测试 gate 在不同运动模式下的行为。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_baseline\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: Walker Walk baseline converged at ~920 eval_return\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 15:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp_004：gate_loss 爆炸 bug（compute_gate_targets 用 gate_max_dt 而非 effective_max_dt），第三次\\\\n    train/imagine distribution mismatch，需全量审计后重启 exp_005\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 gate_loss 从 0 跳到 2.84e8（正常值 ~5），根因：compute_gate_targets 生成\\\\n    8-bin target 分布但 logits masking 只保留 effective_max_dt 个 bin，cross-entropy 在 masked\\\\n    bin 上产生 ~3e8 loss。eval_return@125K=352（baseline 37%）。这是第三次同类 bug（exp_002 subsample/exp_003\\\\n    imagination dt + λ-return/exp_004 gate target vs masking），需要对 gate_max_dt vs effective_max_dt\\\\n    做全量代码审计后再重启。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_004_event_gated_v3\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: negative - gate_loss explosion 2.84e8, return 37% baseline\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: negative - same bug class\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_event_gated\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: failed - same bug class\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: Hard Gumbel gate 结构性失败确认，启动 exp_006 fixed dt=2 诊断实验\\\\n  rationale: exp_003/004/005 三次实验均在 gate_scale>0.5 时发生 return 崩塌。exp_005 是首次在所有 bug\\\\n    修复 + gate_loss 正常(0.53) + gate 行为健康(entropy 1.54, dt_mean 2.44)条件下的崩塌，排除了实现 bug\\\\n    的可能。结论：hard Gumbel gate + variable-rate imagination 与 actor-critic 优化存在结构性冲突。exp_006\\\\n    fixed dt=2 是关键分叉诊断——如果 fixed dt=2 正常则问题在 learned gate 动态选择，如果也崩则问题在 variable-rate\\\\n    imagination 本身。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: return 崩塌 276→25.7 at gate_scale 0.5→0.6\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_004_event_gated_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - 崩塌模式相同\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - 崩塌模式相同\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: 已审批待启动\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: Pivot 决策树调整：exp_006 正常分支下，K=2 binary hard gate 优先于 soft weighted gate\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出两点：(1) A1 soft weighted gate 每步需 K 次 RSSM forward pass，K=8\\\\n    时 8 倍计算开销，与时间抽象节省计算的初衷矛盾；(2) 遗漏了最简诊断方案——K=2 binary hard gate (dt∈{1,2})，保持 hard\\\\n    gate 计算效率，仅缩小离散空间和梯度方差。这能区分\\\\\\\"hard gate 本身有问题\\\\\\\"还是\\\\\\\"只是 K 太大\\\\\\\"。工程量极低（改 gate_max_dt=2）。新决策树：exp_006\\\\n    正常 → 先试 K=2 binary hard gate → 若成功则增量扩 K → 若仍失败再考虑 soft 方案。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: return collapsed to 47.4\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 22:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 D010 pivot 方案：K=2 实现应用 Bernoulli straight-through 或 sigmoid relaxation，而非\\\\n    K=2 Gumbel-Softmax\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 K=2 Gumbel-Softmax 本质仍是 hard categorical gate（与 exp_003-005\\\\n    失败机制相同，只是方差更小），与 memory.md \\\\\\\"不要再尝试 hard categorical gate\\\\\\\" 矛盾。真正的 binary gate 应使用不同梯度估计器：(a)\\\\n    Bernoulli straight-through estimator（离散但梯度路径不同）或 (b) continuous sigmoid relaxation（连续化，彻底避免离散决策）。等\\\\n    exp_006/007 诊断结果出后，若走\\\\\\\"gate 是问题\\\\\\\"分支，优先尝试 Bernoulli ST，次选 sigmoid soft gate。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: evidence_negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 三档 claim 结构确认 + 单 GPU 多实验并行策略 + exp_006 叙事修正\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 深度分析修正了两个关键判断：(1) exp_006@45K 回到 93% baseline，\\\\\\\"超基线 25%\\\\\\\" 是 35K\\\\n    处 baseline 临时回调造成的假象，正确表述是\\\\\\\"跟踪基线 ±10%\\\\\\\"——仍是正向信号（证明 dt=2 不伤害训练），但 claim 不能说\\\\\\\"超越\\\\\\\"。(2)\\\\n    三档 claim 结构：A 档（仅诊断发现，workshop 级）、B 档（Bernoulli ST 成功=方法贡献，CoRL 可投）、C 档（learned\\\\n    gate > fixed dt=最强 CoRL 投稿）。当前距 B 档缺 Bernoulli ST 实验，距 C 档缺 Bernoulli ST + learned>fixed\\\\n    两步。Bernoulli ST 是最高优先级实验。另外 Reviewer 发现 GPU 仅占 4GB/96GB，单 GPU 可并行 3-4 个实验，吞吐量可提升\\\\n    3-4×，对赶 CoRL DDL 意义重大。所有实验当前 seed=1，CoRL 最低要求 3 seeds。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 35K=485.3(125% baseline), 45K=477.0(93% baseline), tracking baseline ±10%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: evidence_negative\\\\n    result: 35K=126.7(33% baseline), declining trend\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: Gumbel gate structural failure confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: dt=4 失败根因定位：actor-critic credit assignment 崩塌，非 RSSM 预测能力不足\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立分析 3-way metrics 发现：(1) exp_007 model_loss 与 baseline/dt=2\\\\n    相当（4.75 vs 4.12 vs 5.23@35K），排除 RSSM 预测能力瓶颈假说；(2) actor_loss@35K 从正常的 -0.577(baseline)/-0.331(dt=2)\\\\n    崩塌到 -0.015(dt=4)，actor 完全停止学习；(3) actor_entropy 从 -2.42@25K 跳到 +1.54@35K，策略退化为随机；(4)\\\\n    value_mean 仅 25.9（baseline 207.8 的 12.5%），critic 严重低估。因果链明确：dt=4 粗粒度 lambda-return\\\\n    → credit assignment 困难 → critic 崩 → actor 失去信号 → 策略崩溃。这个发现对论文有三重价值：(a) 否定了简单的\\\\\\\"模型能力不足\\\\\\\"解释，将问题精确定位在\\\\n    imagination-to-policy interface；(b) 为 dt∈{1,2} sweet spot 提供因果解释而非仅经验观察；(c) 强化\\\\n    Bernoulli ST gate (dt∈{1,2}) 的设计动机。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: actor_loss→0, entropy→random, value 12.5% baseline @35K, model_loss normal\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: actor_loss=-0.331, healthy training @35K\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_baseline\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: actor_loss=-0.577, reference @35K\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_006 55K 跌至 58% baseline，诊断结论更新为\\\\\\\"最优 dt 随训练阶段变化\\\\\\\"；批准 exp_008 Bernoulli\\\\n    ST 立即启动\\\\n  rationale: exp_006 (fixed dt=2) 完整轨迹显示早期加速（15K-35K 超 baseline 67%）但后期衰退（55K 跌至 58%\\\\n    baseline），不符合原假设的场景 A（稳定）也非场景 B（全程有害）。Agent 提出场景 C：最优 dt 是训练阶段的函数——早期 dt=2 加速探索，后期需要细粒度控制。这比\\\\n    A/B 更强地论证了 learned adaptive gate 的必要性。但目前仅单 seed 数据，不能完全排除噪声/过拟合等替代解释。无论如何 Bernoulli\\\\n    ST (dt∈{1,2}) 是下一步必做实验：如果 gate 学会\\\\\\\"早期多 skip 晚期少 skip\\\\\\\"且 return ≥80% baseline，直接验证\\\\n    Scenario C + 达到 B 档 claim。cuda:1 空闲 >3h，立即批准 exp_008。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 早期+67% baseline, 55K跌至58%, 训练阶段依赖性\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: evidence_negative\\\\n    result: 全程~30% baseline, 已关闭\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008_bernoulli_st\\\\n    role: approved\\\\n    result: 待启动 cuda:1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_006 65K 崩塌至 21.6% baseline，所有 dt>1 变体均失败；疑似 subsample curriculum 分布偏移是共同根因，设计无\\\\n    curriculum 对照实验\\\\n  rationale: exp_006 (fixed dt=2) 从 35K=485.3 崩至 65K=132.9 (21.6% baseline)，推翻了\\\\\\\"fixed\\\\n    dt 没问题、问题在 gate\\\\\\\"的诊断假设。Reviewer 指出关键洞察：崩塌窗口 35K-65K 与 subsample_variable_dt curriculum\\\\n    ramp (25K→75K) 精确重叠。即使 fixed_dt 模式，subsample 仍受 curriculum 控制——0-25K 训练数据纯 dt=1\\\\n    但 imagination 用 dt=2，25K-75K 分布剧变。这与 exp_002 的 Phase 1 mismatch 失败模式高度一致。所有 4\\\\n    个 dt>1 实验（exp_003-007）的崩塌都可能由同一根因解释：train/imagine 分布不匹配被 curriculum 延迟暴露。在排除 curriculum\\\\n    混淆因素前，讨论 gate 类型无意义。暂缓 Bernoulli ST (exp_008)，先做无 curriculum 对照：fixed dt=2 + subsample\\\\n    从头用 dt∈{1,2}（无 ramp）+ dt=2 imagination，消除分布偏移。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 65K=132.9 (21.6% baseline), collapsed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: pattern\\\\n    result: similar collapse window 55K-85K\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_event_gated\\\\n    role: pattern\\\\n    result: Phase 1 subsample mismatch, same root cause class\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: D015 curriculum 假设被代码审查推翻；exp_009 改为纯 dt=2 训练+想象（消除 train/imagine 分布偏移），并行分析\\\\n    exp_006 崩塌机制\\\\n  rationale: Agent 代码审查（commit 6159e46）确认：fixed_dt 模式下 curriculum 完全不生效，subsample\\\\n    从 step 0 就用 dt∈{1,2}（58.5%/41.5%），imagination 纯 dt=2。D015/Reviewer 的 curriculum-induced\\\\n    distribution shift 假设不成立。实际分布偏移是常量性的：训练 58.5% dt=1 + 41.5% dt=2，imagination 100%\\\\n    dt=2。exp_009 改为方案 A：subsample min_dt=2（纯 dt=2 训练），imagination dt=2，消除 train/imagine\\\\n    分布偏移。如果稳定→train/imagine 不匹配是根因→所有实验需要匹配训练分布；如果也崩→dt=2 imagination 在 DreamerV3\\\\n    中根本不可行。同时并行分析 exp_006 的 reward/value/policy/actor_loss 详细指标定位崩塌机制。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 65K=132.9, collapsed, curriculum NOT the cause\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009_no_curriculum\\\\n    role: redesigned\\\\n    result: 改为纯 dt=2 train+imagine 对照\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: Reviewer 代码审计证实 curriculum 在 fixed_dt 模式完全不执行；采用 2x2 析因隔离实验设计（exp_008a/008b）替代\\\\n    D016 方案，kill exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n  rationale: '代码 models.py:202-206 显示 gate_fixed_dt>0 时 gate_scale=0.0、effective_max_dt\\\\n    从 step 0 即为固定值，curriculum 完全不参与。D016 基于 curriculum 推翻后的初步分析，Reviewer 代码审计给出更精确的三假说（A:\\\\n    dt=2 imagination lambda-return 偏差 / B: subsample_variable_dt 干扰 / C: dt_embedding\\\\n    质量）和更优隔离设计。2x2 析因：exp_008a(no subsample + dt=2 imag) vs exp_008b(subsample + dt=1\\\\n    imag) 可在 2 GPU 并行 1 轮实验内完全区分根因。exp_006_fixed_dt2 已 132.9@65K (21.6% baseline)\\\\n    确认 negative，继续运行浪费 GPU。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: negative (132.9@65K, 21.6% baseline)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: 'isolation: no subsample + dt=2 imagination'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008b\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: 'isolation: subsample + dt=1 imagination'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_008b 替换为 exp_008c (dt=2, H=8)：隔离 compounding error 假说\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立分析指出：崩塌速度与 dt 完美正相关（dt=4@35K, dt=2@65K, dt=1 不崩），根因可能是 imagination\\\\n    物理时间覆盖过长（H×dt）导致 compounding error，而非 train/imagine 分布不匹配。原 exp_008b（subsample\\\\n    ON + dt=1 imagine）诊断价值低——dt=1 imagination 安全是 trivially true。替换为 exp_008c（dt=2\\\\n    imagine + H=8，物理覆盖≈16步≈baseline 的 15 步）能直接区分\\\\\\\"dt=2 本身有害\\\\\\\"vs\\\\\\\"物理覆盖过长有害\\\\\\\"。若 008a 崩+008c\\\\n    不崩→compounding error 是根因，解法是 H∝1/dt；若都崩→dt=2 RSSM 预测质量本身不足。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a\\\\n    role: 控制组\\\\n    result: 准备中\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c\\\\n    role: 替换 exp_008b\\\\n    result: 准备中\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: 崩塌分析来源\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: 崩塌速度对比\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: Compounding error 假说被 exp_008c 数据反驳；Narrative B（Diagnostic Analysis）确认为最强路径\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 用 eval_return 数据纠正了我对 008c 的误读。核心矛盾：compounding error 假说预测 H=8\\\\n    应优于 H=15（更短 horizon = 更少误差累积），但 eval 数据显示 008c(H=8)@35K=185.1 远劣于 008a(H=15)@35K=500.8。根因是\\\\n    learning signal reduction：H=8 只提供 7 个 imagination step 的梯度信号，lambda-return 积累更少（target=41.2\\\\n    vs 81.5@35K）。此外 008a@35K=500.8 与 exp_006@35K=485.3 惊人相似——exp_006 后续崩塌至 133@65K。dt_embedding\\\\n    混淆未消除（两个实验的 dt_embedding[1] 均未训练），008d 是唯一能消除此混淆的实验。三条 Narrative 排序：B（诊断分析）★★★★\\\\n    > C（诊断+fix 混合）★★★ > A（自适应 horizon 方法论）★★。B 利用全部 11 个实验的失败模式作为诊断证据，任何 008 结果都加分；A\\\\n    的核心 claim 被当前数据反驳。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: 反驳 compounding error 假说\\\\n    result: H=8 eval 远劣于 H=15，与假说预测相反\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: 参照组\\\\n    result: '@35K=500.8 但轨迹类似 exp_006 崩塌前'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: 消除 dt_embedding 混淆\\\\n    result: 仅到 15K，待完成\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: 崩塌参照\\\\n    result: '@35K=485.3 后崩塌至 133@65K'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 因果机制修正：exp_006 崩塌根因是 \\\\\\\"精确 imagination → delusional critic\\\\\\\"，非 \\\\\\\"subsample\\\\n    有毒\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 通过 value/eval 比率分析发现：exp_006 的 value/eval 以 20pp/10K 速度逼近并突破\\\\n    100%（45K=53.3%, 55K=93.3%, 65K=272%），而 008a 仅 23.4%@45K。两者差异核心是 dt_embedding 是否训练——训练后\\\\n    RSSM 精确预测 dt=2 → imagination 产生高 return → value 快速追上 → advantage 枯竭 → 崩塌。未训练的\\\\n    dt_embedding 意外充当悲观 imagination 偏置，阻止 value 过估。这改变了 BernoulliST 设计方向：需要引入 value\\\\n    pessimism 机制或利用 untrained embedding 作为内置悲观偏置。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006\\\\n    role: evidence_崩塌案例\\\\n    result: peak@35K=485.3 then collapse to 132.9@65K, value/eval突破272%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a\\\\n    role: evidence_对照组\\\\n    result: '@45K=563.4仍上升, value/eval仅23.4%, 未训练dt_embedding充当悲观偏置'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c\\\\n    role: evidence_H不足\\\\n    result: H=8 learning signal不足, 非compounding error\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: Delusional critic 因果链闭合：008c vs 008d controlled experiment 直接证明 trained\\\\n    dt_embedding 是 value 过估根因\\\\n  rationale: '008d (subsample ON=dt_emb trained, H=8) @35K: eval=146.3, value/eval=41.2%。008c\\\\n    (subsample OFF=dt_emb untrained, H=8) @35K: eval=185.1, value/eval~19%。同 H 同 dt\\\\n    唯一差异是 dt_emb 训练状态，value 过估翻倍以上。008d@35K 的 41.2% 与 exp_006@35K 的 ~43% 几乎相同，证明无论\\\\n    H=8/H=15，trained dt_emb 在 35K 就产生同等程度 value 过估。因果链：trained dt_emb → RSSM 精确预测\\\\n    dt=2 → optimistic imagination → value overestimation → advantage exhaustion →\\\\n    collapse。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: direct_evidence\\\\n    result: eval=146.3@35K, value/eval=41.2%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: eval=185.1@35K, value/eval~19%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: corroboration\\\\n    result: value/eval~43%@35K, collapse@65K\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 008a@55K=488 确认 no-subsample 阻止 exp_006 崩塌模式；停止已 plateau 的 008c，释放 cuda:1\\\\n    给 008e\\\\n  rationale: 008a@55K=488 vs exp_006@55K=360（+35.4%），value/eval=37.6% 远低于 006 的 53.3%。no-subsample（untrained\\\\n    dt_emb）显著延迟崩塌。008c@55K=242 已 plateau，结论明确（underfitting，非崩塌），无新信息可获取。释放 cuda:1\\\\n    给 008e 做 dt_embedding 训练 vs 使用的因果分离实验，填满 GPU 等待 008a@65K 和 008d@45K 最终确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: '@55K=488, v/e=37.6%, stable vs 006 collapse'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: '@55K=242, plateau confirmed, stopping'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: '@55K=360, collapsed from 485@35K'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 接受 Reviewer critical：C2 confound 需 dt_embed_dim=0 实验消除；当前 008e 测的是 imagination\\\\n    问题而非 dt_embedding 因果归因\\\\n  rationale: 008c vs 008d 同时改变了两件事：(1) dt_embedding 是否被训练 (2) RSSM 训练数据是否包含 dt=2 转移。两者不可分离。当前\\\\n    008e (subsample ON + dt=1 imagination) 测的是 imagination 使用端的因果链，而非 dt_embedding\\\\n    本身。需要 dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON 实验：如果仍崩 → 根因是 RSSM 学到 dt=2 dynamics；如果不崩 →\\\\n    dt_embedding 确实是关键。此实验对 C2 是 blocking dependency。另外 Reviewer 指出 008c v/e@65K=32.8%\\\\n    仍在上升，需标注 step 并修正 C2 证据表。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: v/e@35K=19% → @55K=29.1% → @65K=32.8%, 稳步上升\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: v/e@35K=41.2%, trained dt_emb\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: 测 imagination 使用端，非 dt_embedding 因果归因\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 接受 Reviewer C2 confound 诊断：008e 重新配置为 subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0 + dt=2\\\\n    imag + H=8，直接对照 008d 消除混淆变量\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 正确指出 008c vs 008d 同时改变了 (1) dt_embedding 训练和 (2) RSSM 训练数据。当前\\\\n    008e 用 dt=1 imagination 不能对照 008d（dt=2 imag）。需要：subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0\\\\n    + dt=2 imag + H=8，与 008d 唯一差异为 dt_embedding 有无。若此配置不崩 → dt_embedding 是根因；若崩 →\\\\n    RSSM 学 dt=2 dynamics 本身就导致问题。008e 升级为 MVP-blocking（C2 是核心 claim）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: comparison target\\\\n    result: '@35K eval=146, v/e=41.2%, collapse'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: original control\\\\n    result: '@55K eval=242, v/e=29-33%, plateau'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 008d@45K v/e=69.3% 崩塌确认；kill 008d 释放 cuda:0 给 008f confound control\\\\n  rationale: 008d v/e 轨迹 15.5%→41.2%→69.3%（每10K +25-28pp）完美复现 006 崩塌模式，trained dt_emb\\\\n    → delusional critic 因果链进一步闭合。继续跑无额外信息增益。cuda:0 释放后立即提交 008f（dt_embed_dim=0 confound\\\\n    control），这是 complete_mvp 的最后一个阻塞项。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: v/e=69.3%@45K, collapse confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: 'planned: dt_embed_dim=0 confound control'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 008d@45K 崩塌确认（v/e=69.3%），kill 008d 释放 cuda:0 给 008f confound control\\\\n  rationale: '008d v/e 轨迹 15.5%→41.2%→69.3% 完美复现 006 崩塌模式（006: 31%→53%→93%），trained\\\\n    dt_emb 在 H=8 下 v/e 上升更快。继续跑无额外信息增益。释放算力给 008f（dt_embed_dim=0 confound control）是\\\\n    MVP 最后关键实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: confirmed_collapse\\\\n    result: v/e=69.3%@45K, eval declining 167→146→141\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: reference_collapse\\\\n    result: v/e=31%→53%→93%→collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f\\\\n    role: next_experiment\\\\n    result: confound control dt_embed_dim=0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: C3 措辞决定：采用 \\\\\\\"preventing optimistic drift\\\\\\\" 而非 \\\\\\\"pessimistic bias\\\\\\\"；v/e 诊断重新定义为相对\\\\n    baseline 的超额比率\\\\n  rationale: Baseline v/e 稳态达 69-72%，说明高 v/e 本身不是病态——baseline 在 v/e=70% 时 eval=950\\\\n    是健康的。病态的是 v/e 远超同期 baseline（008d@45K=69% vs baseline@45K=33%，2.1x），同时 eval 停滞/下降。008a\\\\n    v/e=37% 低于 baseline@65K=56%（0.66x），确实有抑制效应，但核心机制不是\\\\\\\"值太低\\\\\\\"而是\\\\\\\"阻止了超额增长\\\\\\\"。措辞采用 Agent\\\\n    综合方案：untrained dt_emb prevents value overestimation drift, keeping v/e at or below\\\\n    baseline levels。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_baseline\\\\n    role: calibration\\\\n    result: 'v/e: 8.7%→24%→33%→40%→56%→72% steady state'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: protected\\\\n    result: v/e stable 37%, 0.66x baseline@65K\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: pathological\\\\n    result: v/e 2.1x baseline@45K, collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2 因果归因确认：dt_embedding conditioning 是 delusional critic 的直接原因。MVP 所有条件满足，准备\\\\n    complete_mvp\\\\n  rationale: 008f（dt_embed_dim=0）vs 008d（dt_embed_dim=32）唯一区别是 dt_embedding，其余完全相同（subsample\\\\n    ON, dt=2, H=8）。008f@35K normalized v/e=0.73x（正常）vs 008d@35K=1.71x（病态）。去掉 dt_embedding\\\\n    后 delusional critic 完全消失，eval 反而上升（+18%@25K, +41%@35K）。加上 008e_v3@45K normalized\\\\n    v/e=0.88x（subsample ON + untrained dt_emb 也正常），排除了 subsample 数据本身导致崩塌的可能。因果链完全闭合：trained\\\\n    dt_embedding → value overestimation drift → actor collapse。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: causal_confirmation\\\\n    result: normalized v/e 0.73x@35K, eval rising\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: causal_contrast\\\\n    result: normalized v/e 1.71x@35K, eval declining, collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3\\\\n    role: confound_control\\\\n    result: normalized v/e 0.88x@45K, subsample ON but untrained dt_emb → no collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: long_term_confirmation\\\\n    result: 105K=778, normalized v/e 0.59x, structural suppression\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream审稿后战略调整：3 seeds不扩5、frame 008e_v3为mitigation、缩窄scope到RSSM/DreamerV3、加Cartpole环境+1个mitigation\\\\n    pilot\\\\n  rationale: Dream worst-case 3/6 Weak Reject，核心问题：scope-claim失配、无mitigation、seeds不足。(1)\\\\n    Seeds：效应量巨大(v/e 69% vs 19.5%)，3 seeds定性一致即可投稿，5 seeds留rebuttal；(2) 008e_v3(dt=1\\\\n    imagination, 95% baseline)本身就是practical mitigation，补1个pilot(uncertainty-gated\\\\n    truncation)；(3) 标题缩窄到RSSM/DreamerV3，讨论泛化性；(4) 加Cartpole Swingup作为非locomotion第4环境，训练快、拓宽scope。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n    role: mitigation_evidence\\\\n    result: 95% baseline, nve=0.80x\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: C2_causal_confirmed\\\\n    result: nve=0.30x, V-recovery to 503\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: C2_collapse_confirmed\\\\n    result: nve=2.09x@45K, collapse\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2因果链降级：009c(seed 2)显示dt_embed_dim=0可能只延迟而非消除delusional critic，normalized\\\\n    v/e加速至1.14x@105K\\\\n  rationale: 008f seed 0恢复到503@105K(nve=0.30x)，但009c seed 2下跌至148@105K(nve=1.14x且加速中)。单seed结论不可靠。C2从\\\\\\\"eliminates\\\\\\\"降级为\\\\\\\"delays\\\\n    onset and reduces severity\\\\\\\"。需延长009c到200K观察是否越过1.5x，并等009f(seed 1)结果判断seed分布。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: seed_0_recovery\\\\n    result: 503@105K, nve=0.30x\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\\\\n    role: seed_2_divergence\\\\n    result: 148@105K, nve=1.14x accelerating\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 选 Option A narrative（机制+陷阱+正确修复），C6(008e_v3)升为crown jewel，新增plan_014(008e_v3\\\\n    seeds 1-2) P0\\\\n  rationale: 009c negative 重新审视后，C2机制识别依然成立（两个seed都无delusional critic），008f问题在于reward退化导致seed-dependent\\\\n    performance。Option A把negative变成故事深度：诊断→显然的修复有陷阱→正确修复(008e_v3)。008e_v3多seed验证成为最关键gap。Cheetah/Cartpole\\\\n    008f复现降优先级。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\\\\n    role: triggered_reframe\\\\n    result: 148@105K, nve=1.14x, no delusional critic but reward degradation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n    role: crown_jewel_candidate\\\\n    result: 870@105K, 95% baseline, nve=0.80x\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2再修订：trained dt_emb → pathological v/e (>1.5x) 是 robust 的(2/2)，但 collapse\\\\n    是 stochastic 的(1/2)。去掉 dt_emb → 0/2 越过 1.5x。1.5x 阈值有完美分离力。\\\\n  rationale: 009b(008d seed 2)未复现 catastrophic collapse，但@45K nve=1.62x 确实越过 1.5x\\\\n    阈值后自我修正到 0.38x@105K。统计：WITH dt_emb 2/2 seeds 越过 1.5x（008d 2.09x, 009b 1.62x），WITHOUT\\\\n    dt_emb 0/2 seeds 越过 1.5x（008f seed 0 max 1.02x, seed 2 max 1.14x）。1.5x 阈值作为诊断标记有完美分离。C2\\\\n    从 \\\\\\\"causes collapse\\\\\\\" 精确为 \\\\\\\"reliably triggers pathological v/e dynamics; catastrophic\\\\n    collapse is stochastic but high-risk\\\\\\\"。这实际上比原始 claim 更精确更可防御。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009b_008d_walker_s2\\\\n    role: seed_2_no_collapse_but_pathological\\\\n    result: nve=1.62x@45K→0.38x@105K, eval=268\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: seed_1_catastrophic_collapse\\\\n    result: nve=2.09x@45K, eval declining\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: seed_0_no_pathological\\\\n    result: max nve=1.02x\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\\\\n    role: seed_2_no_pathological\\\\n    result: max nve=1.14x\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D033: 008e_v3 dt_embedding 实际是 trained — C6 保护机制修正为 imagination dt=1（非\\\\n    embedding 训练状态）'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 代码审计发现 008e_v3 使用 subsample=ON (--gate_subsample_max_dt 2)，dt=1/dt=2\\\\n    transitions 都流经 RSSM，nn.Embedding 默认 trainable 且无 freeze/detach，因此 dt_embedding\\\\n    是 trained。此前标注 \\\\\\\"untrained\\\\\\\" 是错误的。修正后 C6 反而更强：008d (trained dt_emb + dt>1 imag →\\\\n    collapse) vs 008e_v3 (trained dt_emb + dt=1 imag → 95% baseline)，说明关键保护变量是 imagination\\\\n    dt=1，不是 embedding 训练状态。narrative 更干净：不需要改模型架构，只需改 imagination 策略。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success, 95% baseline with trained dt_emb + dt=1 imagination\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: contrast\\\\n    result: collapse with trained dt_emb + dt>1 imagination\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D032\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 27099, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01KvMFu7t7wxihwPseYjFE5w","session_id":"897ba80d-7ac0-4ab3-8af6-91e374677a7e","uuid":"6e65b82c-49d3-414b-90a8-9b834d8694b9","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:57:11.658Z"}
